WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
API Keys vault stores provider credentials once.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Tools expose capabilities — search, media, ops — under entitlements.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
When agents produce files, prefer MEDIA paths and Content Explorer over naked...

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Grant tools per agent; least privilege keeps budgets and blast radius sane.
